{80}{[She takes the forms back from you and looks them over] Yes... Yes... These all seem to be in order. Well then @pcname@, you now have an account at Grayhills Savings and Loans. As a member of our fine institute, you are entitled to several of the banks other services. If you require any assistance, don't hesitate to ask.}{[She takes the forms back from you and looks them over] Yes... Yes... These all seem to be in order. Well then @pcname@, you now have an account at Grayhills Savings and Loans. As a member of our fine institute, you are entitled to several of the banks other services. If you require any assistance, don't hesitate to ask.}{}{}{}{pf800 1, pv802 1000}
